ow on the top]\n[S8T9] (dia_id: D8:9)\n\nDave: I booked a trip to a mountainous region for next month! Finally gonna be able to see those majestic peaks! Gonna be an amazing experience!\n[S8T10] (dia_id: D8:10)\n\nCalvin: Cool, Dave! Have a great time. I'm sure it's going to be an amazing experience. Take lots of pics and show me when you get back.\n[S8T11] (dia_id: D8:11)\n\nDave: Yep, Calvin! Gonna take lots of pics. Can't wait to show you when I get back!\n[S8T12] (dia_id: D8:12)\n\nCalvin: Have fun exploring the mountains, Dave! Safe travels and see you soon. Take care!\n[S8T13] (dia_id: D8:13)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! Take care, see you soon!\n[S8T14] (dia_id: D8:14)","text_sha256":"348181e58917f27f0e5a46d746220de6e4115db28126fee558e05c33557ea3cd","timestamp":"2023-06-09T14:31:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D17:1"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":13,"line_start":12,"source_locators":["[S17T1]"],"text_sha256":"f7fbcec7fb18bfa49d6b4d6e5c0085effbe6488958a16a1592138ee7d006416f"},{"dia_ids":["D17:2"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":16,"line_start":15,"source_locators":["[S17T2]"],"text_sha256":"ada5ae9e6c02d7e73339aaa60f10a6049187401177ce626839d9511c61195608"},{"dia_ids":["D17:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":19,"line_start":18,"source_locators":["[S17T3]"],"text_sha256":"0dba7d209dd664bef1fe17b08c6de202fa925bedaadae948dabbec93f3a15bf1"},{"dia_ids":["D17:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":22,"line_start":21,"source_locators":["[S17T4]"],"text_sha256":"235b6188f1872a157955b103c48ff0307c6f21c6e75f6bafbf5d72586b24b44c"},{"dia_ids":["D17:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":25,"line_start":24,"source_locators":["[S17T5]"],"text_sha256":"690a3fcfd4a95e85516b4143d04a34e1d7ec384f1577b598de27a1a188a8273b"},{"dia_ids":["D17:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":29,"line_start":27,"source_locators":["[S17T6]"],"text_sha256":"baf8f68059bd17fd0c90b6ec79c86dfb8f3280ff4542797c2f57c414d2e6daa4"},